B.acf=new A.ap(62764,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.bqb=new A.q9(B.acf,B.m,"Your Portfolio & Watchlist","Three lists, one place:\n\n\u2022 Portfolio \u2014 stocks you currently own\n\u2022 Watching \u2014 stocks on your radar, not yet bought\n\u2022 Sold \u2014 your full history with realised gains\n\nTap + on any tab to add a stock. Tap \u21bb to refresh all prices at once.","assets/screenshots/portfolio.png")
B.bqa=new A.q9(B.G4,B.cQ,"See your real P&L \u2014 instantly","Enter what you paid per share and the app does the rest.\n\nYour profit or loss, gain in percent, and total return are always up to date with the live price.\n\nBought the same stock multiple times? Each purchase is tracked separately \u2014 your average cost is calculated automatically.\n\nSell a position and the realised gain moves to your Sold tab, permanently preserved.","assets/screenshots/portfolio_summary.png")
B.ac9=new A.ap(62547,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.bqd=new A.q9(B.ac9,B.m,"Tap any stock to explore","Every stock has its own detail page \u2014 tap to open it.\n\n\u2022 Live price chart with adjustable range\n\u2022 Company info \u2014 P/E ratio, sector, Beta, debt levels\n\u2022 Latest news headlines for that company\n\u2022 Your alert price and target price at a glance\n\nEverything you need to evaluate a position, in one place.","assets/screenshots/stock.png")
B.acu=new A.ap(983823,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.bqc=new A.q9(B.acu,B.Dd,"Your personal Journal","Every stock has a private journal \u2014 only you see it.\n\nWrite down why you bought, what your exit plan is, or how the thesis is playing out.\n\nMonths later, when you're wondering why you held or sold, your reasoning is right there.\n\nFind the journal at the bottom of any stock's detail page.","assets/screenshots/stock_2.png")
B.acn=new A.ap(63548,"MaterialIcons",!0)
B.bq9=new A.q9(B.acn,B.K,"Portfolio Tags \u2014 your sub-portfolios",'Split your holdings into separate portfolios with a tag \u2014 "Tech", "Dividend", "ISA", "Broker A", whatever makes sense to you.\n\nEach holding belongs to one portfolio tag, so you can even hold the same stock in two \u2014 e.g. the same share at two brokers. Set the tag when you add a stock, or from its detail page any time.\n\nFilter by portfolio tag in the Portfolio or Analysis tab to instantly see totals and charts for just that portfolio.\n\nStocks in different currencies? Set your display currency in Settings and everything converts to one clean total.',"assets/screenshots/portfolio_tag.png")
B.bq6=new A.q9(B.qC,B.Q,"Powerful analysis, zero setup","The Analysis tab does the maths the moment you add stocks:\n\n\u2022 Equity curve \u2014 your total portfolio value over time\n\u2022 Value at Risk \u2014 your realistic worst-day loss estimate\n\u2022 Beta \u2014 how your portfolio moves vs the market\n\u2022 Opportunity cost \u2014 did your watchlist outperform what you own?\n\nTap a tag at the top to run every chart for just that group.","assets/screenshots/analysis_tab_1.png")
B.a5i=new A.V(1,0.8509803921568627,0,0.3686274509803922,B.r)
B.bq8=new A.q9(B.dH,B.a5i,"Goals & Alerts","Two ways to stay on track:\n\nGoals \u2014 set a target portfolio value. The app tracks your progress and shows how close you are over time.\n\nAlert price \u2014 set a price level on any stock and the app flags it the moment the stock crosses that level.\n\nTarget price \u2014 set where you want a stock to go. The app always shows how far away it is as a percentage.","assets/screenshots/analysis_tab_3.png")
B.bq7=new A.q9(B.qF,B.cQ,"You're all set!","The full App Guide is always one tap away.\n\nGo to Settings \u2192 Feature Guide & Glossary for a searchable reference covering every metric, formula, and feature \u2014 from P/E ratio to Value at Risk.\n\nYou can also relaunch this guide any time from the bottom of that screen.\n\nWelcome to Portfolio Keeper.",null)
